{"id":"serseng-su-anbari","qid":"Q1768177","category":"reservoir","type":"hydronym","names":{"az":"Sərsəng su anbarı","ru":"Сарсангское водохранилище","en":"Sarsang Reservoir"},"coordinates":[46.61056,40.17642],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"qarabag","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q2025789","az":"Ağdərə rayonu","en":"Aghdara District"}],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Sərsəng su anbarı — Azərbaycana məxsus 1976-cı ildə Tərtərçayın üzərində, Ağdərə ərazisində inşa edilmiş su anbarı. Onun ümumi su tutumu 560 mln m³, bəndinin hündürlüyü isə 125 m-dir. Sərsəng su anbarı respublikada bəndinin hündürlüyünə görə ən hündür bəndli su anbarlarından biridir. Sərsəng su anbarı respublikanın 6 rayonunun (Ağdərə, Ağdam, Bərdə, Goranboy, Yevlax və Ağcabədi) 100 min hektara yaxın torpaq sahəsini suvarma suyu ilə təmin edirdi.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Сарсангское водохранилище (азерб. Sərsəng su anbarı) — водохранилище на реке Тертер в Агдеринском районе Азербайджана, крупнейшее по размерам в Карабахском экономическом районе. Объём воды — 0,56 км³, площадь — 13,85 км². Обеспечивает водой Сарсангскую ГЭС.\nС начала 1990-х годов до военной операции Азербайджана в сентябре 2023 года фактически контролировалось непризнанной Нагорно-Карабахской Республикой согласно административно-территориальному делению которой располагалось в Мартакертском районе.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"The Sarsang Reservoir (Azerbaijani: Sərsəng su anbarı, Armenian: Սարսանգի ջրամբար, romanized: Sarsangi jrambar) is a reservoir located in the Tartar and Kalbajar districts of Azerbaijan. The reservoir was formed by the construction of a dam on the Tartar River. The overall volume of the reservoir is 575 million m3.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Sarsang_Reservoir_01.jpg/960px-Sarsang_Reservoir_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Sarsang_Reservoir_01.jpg/960px-Sarsang_Reservoir_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":533,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sarsang_Reservoir_01.jpg","title":"Sarsang Reservoir 01.jpg","artist":"Julian Nyča","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q1768177: Sarsang Reservoir","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1768177","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Sərsəng su anbarı","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=S%C9%99rs%C9%99ng_su_anbar%C4%B1&oldid=9108755","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/S%C9%99rs%C9%99ng_su_anbar%C4%B1","revid":9108755,"revDate":"2026-09-16","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Сарсангское водохранилище","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%A1%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B3%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B5_%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%85%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%89%D0%B5&oldid=156106554","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A1%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B3%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B5_%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%85%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%89%D0%B5","revid":156106554,"revDate":"2026-11-10","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Sarsang Reservoir","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Sarsang_Reservoir&oldid=1366624060","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sarsang_Reservoir","revid":1366624060,"revDate":"2026-07-29","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Sarsang Reservoir 01.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sarsang_Reservoir_01.jpg","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"review"}